/text><text for="L35">回家 出人头地 享受光速网络</text><text for="L36">我不想谈论往日的模样</text><text for="L37">离开美国 两个孩子跟随着她</text><text for="L38">我不想谈论是谁先这样做</text><text for="L39">Hey!</text><text for="L40">如同往昔</text><text for="L41">你知道一切已不复从前</text><text for="L42">不复往昔</text><text for="L43">不复从前</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:36.238"><div begin="0:14.201" end="2:36.238"><p begin="0:14.201" end="0:15.569" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.201" end="0:14.856">Holding</span> <span begin="0:14.856" end="0:15.052">me</span> <span begin="0:15.052" end="0:15.569">back</span></p><p begin="0:16.272" end="0:18.297" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.272" end="0:16.980">Gravity's</span> <span begin="0:16.980" end="0:17.498">holding</span> <span begin="0:17.498" end="0:17.694">me</span> <span begin="0:17.694" end="0:18.297">back</span></p><p begin="0:18.889" end="0:21.643" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.889" end="0:19.097">I</span> <span begin="0:19.097" end="0:19.413">want</span> <span begin="0:19.413" end="0:19.615">you</span> <span begin="0:19.615" end="0:19.817">to</span> <span begin="0:19.817" end="0:20.067">hold</span> <span begin="0:20.067" end="0:20.329">out</span> <span begin="0:20.329" end="0:20.519">the</span> <span begin="0:20.519" end="0:20.817">palm</span> <span begin="0:20.817" end="0:20.995">of</span> <span begin="0:20.995" end="0:21.245">your</span> <span begin="0:21.245" end="0:21.643">hand</span></p><p begin="0:21.783" end="0:23.785" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.783" end="0:22.140">Why</span> <span begin="0:22.140" end="0:22.437">don't</span> <span begin="0:22.437" end="0:22.646">we</span> <span begin="0:22.646" end="0:22.913">leave</span> <span begin="0:22.913" end="0:23.134">it</span> <span begin="0:23.134" end="0:23.342">at</span> <span begin="0:23.342" end="0:23.785">that?</span></p><p begin="0:25.231" end="0:26.566" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span 